    <briefdescription>
<para>Generic <ref refid="classcsmp_1_1_test" kindref="compound">Test</ref> for any FEM subclass. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><simplesect kind="author"><para>Philipp Lang</para>
</simplesect>
Uses the <ref refid="classcsmp_1_1_finite_element___test_data" kindref="compound">FiniteElement_TestData</ref> class to test FEMs. Please see there for instructions on the text file that is used for testing.</para>
<para><xrefsect id="todo_1_todo000249"><xreftitle>Todo</xreftitle><xrefdescription><para>(3) ConsecutiveNodesAtBoundary Test(not implemented for most FEMs) </para>
<para>(3) Think about _equal vs _test in some cases </para>
<para>(3) Add more feedback when ordering matters</para>
</xrefdescription></xrefsect></para>
<sect1 id="classcsmp_1_1_finite_element___test_1prerequisites">
<title>FEM Prerequisites</title><para>Coordinate matrix has to be at least of size 2x2, meaning no less than a 2D line element may be tested. </para>
</sect1>
